  "sourceTitle": "Pizza Sauce with Anise",
  "sourceText": "Pizza Sauce with Anise\nBy: Cresent\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 6-oz can tomato paste\n2 8-oz cans tomato sauce\n2 teaspoons Anise seeds, freshly ground\n1/4 teaspoon Pepper\n1/4 teaspoon Garlic powder\n1 teaspoon Oregano\n1 teaspoon Italian seasonings\n1 teaspoon Chopped parsley\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Grind the anise seeds. Mix together all ingredients. Spread on your favorite pizza crust or dough. \n\nTop with veggies and whatever other toppings you are using.\n\nBake.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "1 6-oz can tomato paste"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 8-oz cans tomato sauce"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 teaspoons Anise seeds, freshly ground"
      },
      {
